# Scripts and configs that run on Linux machines (titanxp, the RIT cluster) must keep Unix line endings in every checkout and in `git archive`
# (core.autocrlf=true on the Windows laptop otherwise turns them into CRLF, which Slurm rejects and bash cannot run).
*.sh text eol=lf
*.sbatch text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
